codex
- [RESOLVED] R3 — multi-segment MP4 joining added
  `_exportType1()` now routes multi-segment progressive MP4 inputs through `Mp4Remuxer.joinMp4()` instead of exporting separate files, while unsupported cases still fall back to preserved originals. The new joiner is wired via `part 'mp4_join.dart'` and has targeted tests for sample-table reading and joined output.

- [RESOLVED] R4 — comment image directory creation fixed
  `CommentImages.save()` now creates `comments_images/` before downloading the `.part` file at `lib/services/download/download_extras.dart:491`. That closes the remaining gap where pictures/emotes silently failed to save.

- [RESOLVED] R6 — iOS product name and IPA packaging fixed
  iOS now uses `LibrePili.app` in the project product reference/scheme, and all three `PRODUCT_NAME` entries are set to `LibrePili`. The iOS workflow also codesigns/zips `Payload/LibrePili.app`.

TOTAL: ROUND-OK
